<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20820" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρᾰδύ-ττω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔβρᾰσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐβράσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέβρασμαι</span> (v.
				infr.):—<i>shake violently, throw up</i>, of the
			sea, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκολόπενδραν . . ἔβρασ᾽ ἐπὶ σκοπέλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.222
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Theodorid.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν πρέσβυν . . ἔβρασε . . εἰς
				ἠϊόνα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.294
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Tull.Laur.
			</span></i>): —
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέα . . βέβρασται . . τῇδε
				παρ᾽ ἠϊόνι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				288
			</span></i> (Antip.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.779
			</span></i>; <i>boil</i>, of surf, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.323
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.476
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ὑπὸ γέλωτος</span>
			<i>shake</i> with laughter, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Eun.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>winnow</i> grain, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				271
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				226b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράζω</span>
			, <i>boil</i>, interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				7.15.20
			</span></i>; dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράττειν: πληθύνειν, βαρύνειν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
